"If the picture fits the desktop size, this mode works like the centered option. "
"If the picture is larger than the desktop then it is scaled down to fit while "
"keeping the aspect ratio."
msgstr "ជា ជា ដល់ សមាមាត្រ."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:186
