#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:188
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Magnify the picture without distorting it until it fills both the width and "
"height of the desktop (cropping the picture if necessary), and then center it "
"on the desktop."
msgstr "ទទឹង និង កម្ពស់ និង."

