#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:241
#, no-c-format
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"By choosing this mode, you select two colors (using both color buttons). &kde; "
"will then start with the color selected by <guilabel>Primary Color</guilabel> "
"in each corner of the screen, and slowly transform into the color selected by "
"<guilabel>Blend Color</guilabel> as it moves to the center of the screen. The "
